### Testa API:t direkt från VS Code (tillägget "REST Client")
@api = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Registrera
POST {{api}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "testare", "password": "hemligt123" }

### 2. Logga in – kopiera "token" från svaret till @token nedan
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "testare", "password": "hemligt123" }

###
@token = KLISTRA_IN_TOKEN_HÄR

### 3. Utan token -> 401
GET {{api}}/books

### 4. Med token -> 200
GET {{api}}/books
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Skapa bok
POST {{api}}/books
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Röda rummet", "author": "August Strindberg", "publishedDate": "1879-11-01", "genre": "Roman" }

### 6. Hämta citat
GET {{api}}/quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
